</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008805500</span>8,805<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">0 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Deal_and_the_Demon\" title=\"The Deal and the Demon\">The Deal and the Demon</a></b>, Mercenary Chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li>One of the following ability bonuses:\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\"> Dexterity +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\"> Dexterity +8</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more nimble and dexterous, granting a +8 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Dexterity.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Insightful Dexterity +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Insightful Dexterity +3</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more nimble and dexterous, granting a +3 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Dexterity.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +8</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +8 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Insightful Wisdom +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Insightful Wisdom +3</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +3 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Bonus\">Armor Bonus +9</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Armor_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Bonus\">Armor Bonus +9</a>:</b> This item surrounds the wearer with an invisible but tangible field of force, granting +9 armor bonus to AC, just as though he were wearing armor.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a>:</b> Passive: +6 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhanced_Ki\" title=\"Enhanced Ki\">Enhanced Ki +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhanced_Ki\" title=\"Enhanced Ki\">Enhanced Ki +1</a>:</b> Increases the rate at which the user gains ki with each successful attack.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Reinforced_Fists\" title=\"Reinforced Fists\">Reinforced Fists</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Reinforced_Fists\" title=\"Reinforced Fists\">Reinforced Fists</a>:</b> This item surrounds your fists with kinetic energy. Your unarmed damage is boosted by one half die.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration +15</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration +15</a>:</b> Passive: +15 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Vitality\" title=\"Vitality\">Vitality +20</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vitality\" title=\"Vitality\">Vitality +20</a>:</b> Passive: +20 Vitality bonus to Hit Points.</span></span></li>\n<li>Upgrade:\n<ul><li>375 <a href=\"/page/Purple_Dragon_Knights\" title=\"Purple Dragon Knights\">Purple Dragon Knights Favor</a> and 15 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Villagers_of_Eveningstar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Villagers of Eveningstar\">Commendation: Villagers of Eveningstar</a> adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Way_of_the_Sun_Soul\" title=\"Named item sets\">Way of the Sun Soul</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Way_of_the_Sun_Soul\" title=\"Named item sets\">Way of the Sun Soul</a>:</b> When all three item from the set are equipped and you are in a centered state, you will gain +2 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to To-Hit and Damage rolls. In addition, when you roll a natural 20 on an attack roll that is confirmed as a critical hit, you will gain temporary benefit based on the elemental stance you are in, if any.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Spider-spun_Caparison.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Spider-spun_Caparison.png/420px-Spider-spun_Caparison.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"443\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Spider-spun_Caparison.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Catalyst_Crafting\" title=\"Catalyst Crafting\">Catalyst Crafting</a> to \n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Item:Webs_of_the_Drow_Penitent\" title=\"Item:Webs of the Drow Penitent\">Webs of the Drow Penitent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Webs_of_the_Drow_Penitent\" title=\"Item:Legendary Webs of the Drow Penitent\">Legendary Webs of the Drow Penitent</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>The cloth of this outfit is spun entirely from the silk of some arachnid. It is strong, flexible, and nearly weightless.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>Can be made a part of the <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Way_of_the_Sun_Soul\" title=\"Named item sets\">Way of the Sun Soul</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Way_of_the_Sun_Soul\" title=\"Named item sets\">Way of the Sun Soul</a>:</b> When all three item from the set are equipped and you are in a centered state, you will gain +2 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to To-Hit and Damage rolls. In addition, when you roll a natural 20 on an attack roll that is confirmed as a critical hit, you will gain temporary benefit based on the elemental stance you are in, if any.</span></span> with 375 <a href=\"/page/Purple_Dragon_Knights\" title=\"Purple Dragon Knights\">Purple Dragon Knights Favor</a> and 15 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Villagers_of_Eveningstar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Villagers of Eveningstar\">Commendation: Villagers of Eveningstar</a> by talking to <a href=\"/page/Mikrom_Sum\" title=\"Mikrom Sum\">Mikrom Sum</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Upgrading item does not change binding status; so an unbound version will remain trade-able.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817221046\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.110 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.155 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6823/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47847/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 17568/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n105.88%  138.754     88 Template:IO\n100.00%  131.048      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  131.048      1 -total\n 97.40%  127.646      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 34.39%   45.064      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 33.51%   43.909      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 31.97%   41.899      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 31.21%   40.897     16 Template:Popup\n 31.12%   40.788      2 Template:InCategory\n 16.75%   21.947      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24436-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817221046 and revision id 694458. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
